** Unlimited List Nesting

Standard LaTeX limits lists to 4 levels. With this config, nest up to 20 levels:

#+begin_src latex
\\begin{itemize}
  \\item Level 1
  \\begin{itemize}
    \\item Level 2
    \\begin{itemize}
      \\item Level 3
      % ... continue to level 20
    \\end{itemize}
  \\end{itemize}
\\end{itemize}
#+end_src

