* Seforim Library

Complete indexed search system for a very large Hebrew text library using **Dirvish** instead of standard Dired.

| Tool     | Purpose              | Speed    |
|----------|----------------------|----------|
| plocate  | Find by filename     | instant  |
| recoll   | Full-text search     | instant  |
| ripgrep  | Fallback search      | fast     |
| fd       | Fallback file find   | fast     |

** Configuration

#+begin_src emacs-lisp
(defgroup seforim nil
  \"Seforim library configuration.\"
  :group 'applications
  :prefix \"seforim-\")

(defcustom seforim-directory (expand-file-name \"~/Documents/seforim/\")
  \"Root directory of the seforim library.\"
  :type 'directory
  :group 'seforim)

;; You asked to only search ORG files.
(defcustom seforim-file-extensions '(\"org\")
  \"File extensions to include in searches.\"
  :type '(repeat string)
  :group 'seforim)

;; NixOS default plocate DB path (matches your system: /var/cache/locatedb)
(defcustom seforim-plocate-db \"/var/cache/locatedb\"
  \"Path to the plocate database.\"
  :type 'file
  :group 'seforim)

(defcustom seforim-plocate-min-query-length 2
  \"Minimum query length before running plocate.
This prevents accidental huge queries on very large libraries.\"
  :type 'integer
  :group 'seforim)

;; Ensure the seforim directory exists to avoid startup errors
(unless (file-exists-p seforim-directory)
  (make-directory seforim-directory t))
#+end_src

** Dependencies

