* Keybinding Reference                                             :noexport:

| Key             | Command                             | Description                        |
|-----------------+-------------------------------------+------------------------------------|
| C-c d           | my/toggle-direction                 | Toggle RTL/LTR direction           |
| C-c r           | my/set-rtl                          | Set RTL (Hebrew)                   |
| C-c l           | my/set-ltr                          | Set LTR (English)                  |
| C-c B           | my/toggle-bidi-reordering           | Toggle bidi reordering             |
| C-c D           | hydra-direction/body                | Direction controls menu            |
| C-c P           | hydra-document/body                 | Document systems menu              |
| C-c F           | hydra-latex-footnotes/body          | LaTeX footnotes menu               |
| F9              | toggle-input-method                 | Toggle Hebrew/English input        |
| C-c s e         | my/spell-english                    | English spell check                |
| C-c s h         | my/spell-hebrew                     | Hebrew spell check                 |
| C-c s b         | my/spell-both                       | Both EN+HE spell checking          |
| M-$             | jinx-correct                        | Correct word at point              |
| C-M-$           | jinx-languages                      | Change jinx languages              |
|-----------------+-------------------------------------+------------------------------------|
| C-c w           | my/toggle-focused-writing           | Toggle 80-col centered mode        |
| C-c W           | my/set-focused-writing-width        | Set focused writing width          |
|-----------------+-------------------------------------+------------------------------------|
| C-x u           | undo-tree-visualize                 | Visual undo tree                   |
| C-/             | undo-tree-undo                      | Undo                               |
| C-?             | undo-tree-redo                      | Redo                               |
|-----------------+-------------------------------------+------------------------------------|
| C-c n f         | org-roam-node-find                  | Find roam node                     |
