| C-c n t         | org-roam-tag-add                    | Add tag to node                    |
| C-c n r         | org-roam-ref-add                    | Add ref to node                    |
| C-c n a         | org-roam-alias-add                  | Add alias to node                  |
| C-c n d         | org-roam-dailies-goto-today         | Go to today's daily note           |
| C-c n D         | org-roam-dailies-goto-date          | Go to specific date's daily        |
